  "以下列出本專案依賴及建置工具的授權；不表示所有工具均包含於網站或 APK。原生間接依賴仍須按正式建置產物比對。第三方名稱不代表對本產品背書。": "The following licenses cover project dependencies and build tools; not all tools are shipped in the website or APK. Native transitive dependencies must be checked against release builds. Third-party names do not imply endorsement.",
