  "每批最多 100 筆。先輸入並核對，全部通過後一次儲存；股數以「股」為單位。": "Enter up to 100 transactions, review them, then save the entire batch. Enter quantities in shares.",
  "從 Excel 貼上買賣": "Paste trades from Excel",
  "欄位順序：類型、日期、時間、股票代號、股數、成交價、手續費、稅額、匯率、帳戶。用 Tab 分隔；類型填買入／賣出或 buy／sell。日期填 YYYY-MM-DD，時間可留空。同代號有多個帳戶時須填帳戶。": "Column order: type, date, time, symbol, shares, price, fee, tax, FX, account. Separate with tabs. Use buy or sell, YYYY-MM-DD dates, and optional HH:mm times. Specify the account if a symbol has multiple accounts.",
  "貼上交易資料": "Paste transaction data",
  "加入草稿": "Add to draft",
  "新增一筆": "Add a row",
  "預覽核對": "Preview and review",
