  "配息公告查詢中，請稍候再核對。": "Dividend announcements are loading. Please wait before reviewing.",
  "投資資料已變更，請重新開啟批次交易。": "Investment data has changed. Reopen batch transactions.",
  "整本帳簿的持有成本變動": "Change in total ledger holding cost",
  "整本帳簿的已實現損益變動": "Change in total ledger realized gain",
  "補登舊交易也會重算後續賣出的 FIFO 成本。儲存後可在交易紀錄逐筆編輯或刪除。": "Backdated entries also recalculate FIFO costs for later sales. After saving, edit or delete each entry in transaction history.",
