  "日期不正確或晚於今天。": "Invalid or future date.",
  "時間請填 HH:mm。": "Enter time as HH:mm.",
  "股數與成交價不可留空。": "Shares and price are required.",
  "請核對配息期別，股息總額依實際入帳明細填寫。": "Review the dividend event and enter the gross total from your payment statement.",
  "手動填寫": "Entered manually",
  "完整履歷採 FIFO 重算，歷史損益與剩餘均價可能不同於原備份的移動平均結果。": "Full history is recalculated using FIFO. Past gains and remaining average cost may differ from the backup's moving-average results.",
  "一鍵更新使用 TWSE／TPEx 最近收盤價、Nasdaq 最新可取得行情及 Frankfurter 參考匯率，不保證即時。只傳送市場與股票代號，不傳送持股、交易及帳戶資料。各檔顯示價格日期與來源；失敗時保留原價格。交易日匯率仍由成交明細填寫，不會被行情更新改寫。新臺幣損益採先進先出（FIFO）；依股票與帳戶，先扣除最早買入的持股。買入費稅加入該批成本，賣出費稅從收入扣除。未實現損益含匯率影響，不預扣未來賣出費稅。期初持股不視為現金支出。同日依交易時間及登記順序計算。資料預設儲存在目前瀏覽器；啟用 Google Drive 備份後，備份會傳至你授權的 Google 帳戶。可於設定匯出一般或加密備份。": "Quotes use recent TWSE/TPEx closes, available Nasdaq prices and Frankfurter reference FX rates; they may be delayed. Only markets and symbols are sent, never holdings, transactions or accounts. Each quote shows its date and source; failed updates keep previous values. Trade FX rates are entered per transaction and remain unchanged. TWD profit uses FIFO cost, including purchase costs and deducting sale costs. Unrealized profit includes currency movements and excludes future selling costs. Opening balances are not cash outflows. Same-day entries follow trade time and entry order. Data is stored in this browser by default. If you enable Google Drive backup, backups are sent to the Google account you authorize. Export a standard or encrypted backup in Settings.",
