  "目前沒有待領配息；有持股與官方公告時會自動加入。": "No expected dividends yet. Entries appear automatically when holdings and official announcements are available.",
  "部分公告尚未更新": "Some announcements could not be refreshed",
  "未除息以目前股數暫估，已除息依除息前持股估算；實際金額仍以入帳明細為準。未公布的日期或金額不會推估。刪除後不會被自動加回。": "Before the ex-date, amounts use current holdings. After the ex-date, they use pre-ex-date holdings. Confirm actual amounts from your statement. Unannounced dates and amounts stay unknown. Deleted entries are not added back automatically.",
