  "ETF 盤中淨值狀態不正確。": "Invalid intraday ETF NAV status.",
  "盤中預估淨值目前支援群益、富邦投信公布的台幣 ETF。自動查詢於台北時間平日 09:00～13:30、投資頁可見且未開啟編輯視窗時進行，每 60 秒查詢一次。非交易日或來源未更新時仍可能查無資料；超過 3 分鐘會標示過期。折溢價及對照市價採投信同批資料，收盤後僅供參考。預估淨值獨立保存，不會改寫每日公告、持股市值或交易成本。": "Intraday estimated NAV currently supports TWD ETFs published by Capital and Fubon. Queries run every 60 seconds on weekdays from 09:00 to 13:30 Taipei time, while the investment page is visible and no editor is open. Data may be unavailable on non-trading days or when the issuer has not updated it. Estimates older than three minutes are marked stale. Premium/discount and market price come from the same issuer update; after market close they are for reference. Estimated NAV is saved separately from daily publications, portfolio market values and transaction costs.",
