  "基本月薪＋伙食津貼＋職務津貼＋夜班津貼＋自定義固定項目，再除以 240。": "Base monthly pay + meal, position and night shift allowances + custom fixed earnings, divided by 240.",
  "換算基本月薪＋固定津貼，再除以正常工時。": "Converted monthly base pay + fixed allowances, divided by regular hours.",
  "以上固定項目會帶入新建薪資，並計入加班與請假扣薪基準。單次加項請在每月薪資明細輸入。": "These fixed earnings populate new payroll records and count toward overtime and leave deduction bases. Enter one-time earnings in monthly payroll details.",
  "薪資變更自今天起生效；既有薪資單與已儲存的加班時薪保持不變。": "Pay changes take effect today. Existing payroll records and saved overtime hourly rates are preserved.",
