  "台股：TWSE 最新成交／TWSE、TPEx 收盤 · 美股：Nasdaq 最新可用行情 · 基金：手動維護公布淨值": "Taiwan: TWSE latest trades / TWSE and TPEx closing prices · US: latest available Nasdaq quotes · Funds: manually maintained published NAV",
